    <http://example.org/node/chunk148> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, every interaction will be logged for posterior audit, ensuring transparency and accountability. our company's past experience with similar use cases, such as the medical-documentation pilot for a regional hospital group, has demonstrated the effectiveness of our AI model in improving the quality of written outputs and reducing processing times. our company's can build on this expertise to design an AI solution that meets the client's specific needs." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk149> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of performance benchmarks, our company's Sovereign European open-weight model has been shown to provide strong grounding behavior, which is essential for explainability-driven and sovereignty-driven requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk15> a prov:Entity ;
