    <http://example.org/node/chunk151> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To facilitate continuity of care, our solution will provide structured handover summaries that allow staff to efficiently take over an in-progress dossier with full context. structured handover summaries that allow staff to efficiently take over an in-progress dossier with full context, combined with our AI model ability to recall applicable rules and regulations, will ensure that clinical staff have access to accurate and up-to-date information, enabling clinical staff to make informed decisions and provide high-quality patient care." ;
